# and a missing path is 404 text/plain. Measured 21 Nov 2026: an .html file
# is also served at the extensionless path and at the trailing-slash path
# (banner-3x3-vibecheck.html, banner-3x3-vibecheck, and banner-3x3-vibecheck/
# share one etag). public/support.html therefore covers /support and /support/
